7592186083299 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084441 #edb/ref 1064 "The **general standard equation** of a hyperbola centered at $(h, k)$ has two forms.\n\n- The equation for a horizontal hyperbola is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {(x - h)^2} {a^2} - \\dfrac {(y - k)^2} {b^2} = 1.\n$$\n\n![](images/86/86896528522f859d4809e922a52e03244fb5279248093dddf302d730e9a542e5.png)\n\n- The equation for a vertical hyperbola is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {(y - k)^2} {a^2} - \\dfrac {(x - h)^2} {b^2} = 1.\n$$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b099f7c4bc8b68e55b17dada9038a934c7bad668e0f4de518c603b1ca58f45.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084441 #edb/ref 1065 3492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084441 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "d86d9561-74bd-5438-8125-87229308ffb8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084441 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186238602 #edb/ref 1080 "(2,4)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186238602 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186238602 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3e982ecf-50aa-5265-ab59-2a7cd50d4cf4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239257 #edb/ref 1080 "(4,2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239257 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239257 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8a05fb7b-ff3d-59b6-ae7e-c48371bbd54b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239644 #edb/ref 1080 "(-2,2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239644 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239644 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b5fe10d0-96f2-5ba4-98c4-144d00023311" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239816 #edb/ref 1080 "(2,2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239816 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186239816 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c7f87bb8-2f3c-5c32-bdbf-781f71dbbb76" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186240278 #edb/ref 1080 "(2,-2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186240278 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186240278 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fb7fe14e-1e8e-